Subject: [PATCH] tools/hex2hcd: include libgen.h for basename

basename() is declared by <libgen.h>.  musl does not expose it through
<string.h>, so building BlueZ 5.72 with Clang fails with an implicit
function declaration in tools/hex2hcd.c.

Upstream-Status: Pending

diff --git a/tools/hex2hcd.c b/tools/hex2hcd.c
index d6ed3e3..7350715 100644
--- a/tools/hex2hcd.c
+++ b/tools/hex2hcd.c
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@
 #include <fcntl.h>
 #include <unistd.h>
 #include <string.h>
+#include <libgen.h>
 #include <getopt.h>
 #include <dirent.h>
 #include <stdint.h>
